{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107444","id":2586733719,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6aLmyX","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107444","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107444.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107444.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107444","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107444/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107444/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107444/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2d0ff9774dd47eb827db16fb7cef8eb7c222f707","number":107444,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add a smoke test for non-empty `nullptr` `Span`","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Follow-up to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107422\r\n\r\nThe above bug occurred because a `Span` was created from `nullptr` with a `size > 0`. This is incorrect, because it's promising access to a memory region that does not exist.\r\n\r\nWe can catch this, at least for the `nullptr` case, by adding a smoke test. This should help us catch such bugs early in the future. The above bug could only have occurred in `DEBUG` builds, so it would have been prevented by this test.\r\n\r\nThe test is pretty cheap, so it shouldn't create performance problems for `DEBUG`. I'd still hesitate to add it to `RELEASE` because correct code should not need it, and in hot loops, it may actually prevent vectorization. Plus, setting `_len = 0` is unlikely to be the correct fix anyway (though it _should_ be better than nothing).\r\n\r\n**Note:** Unfortunately, this change requires the function to be non-`constexpr`, because `ERR_PRINT` isn't `constexpr`. This can be fixed in c++20 with `std::is_constant_evaluated`. Fortunately, we do not use this property yet, so for Godot 4.5 we can give it up. In 4.6, we're planning to [upgrade to C++20](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100749), so we can re-add `constexpr` then.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"S